Comment: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Truly, truly,
Comment: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k18}{\k23}A{\k23}ta{\k27}shi {\k35}na{\k35}no {\k159}sa{\k0}
Comment: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,It’s really me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.11,0:01:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Forty-Second Episode\NThe Rat Man\NThe Great Rat Removal Strategy
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.02,0:02:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's to good health and good fortune, my friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.60,0:02:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What a glorious day! What a glorious day!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.26,0:02:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, so pretty!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.14,0:02:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.29,0:02:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going too!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.91,0:02:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait for me. I'm coming too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.75,0:02:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, not dressed like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.66,0:02:46.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Please wait for me then.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.40,0:02:54.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You're terrible, Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.47,0:02:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry to keep you waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.70,0:02:57.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.72,0:03:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Now THIS is a fantastic party!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.96,0:03:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,A bumper crop! A bumper crop!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.30,0:03:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, drink up! Drink up!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.28,0:03:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, look at that! We've got a bumper crop of rats this year, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.21,0:03:44.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.35,0:04:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,My dear rats, Silverland's storehouse is full of delicious wheat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.48,0:04:14.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Go quickly and eat up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.70,0:04:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Where on earth did so many rats come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.00,0:04:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,This has turned into a disaster...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.86,0:04:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.32,0:04:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We're in real trouble...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.25,0:05:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over. There's nothing left to eat in this kingdom until the next harvest.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.06,0:05:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget that! At this rate, we won't even have food on the table today!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.34,0:05:18.17,Default,,0,0,0,,At this rate, we're all going to starve to death!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.62,0:05:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Duralumin, did you see the surfing in the village last night?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.28,0:05:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You certainly went on a rampage again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.18,0:05:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, I'd expect no less from the Rat Man sent by Lord X.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.04,0:05:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What incredible power!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.46,0:05:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,If Lord X's army invades next month, this kingdom won't stand a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.89,0:05:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Starving soldiers won't even have the energy to run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.49,0:05:59.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I am an envoy from Goldland. I bring a letter for the King of Silverland.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.70,0:06:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What? From Goldland?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.59,0:06:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hear me, everyone!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.03,0:06:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The King of neighboring Goldland, moved by our recent disaster, {\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.64,0:06:18.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}has agreed to lend us wheat.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.54,0:06:25.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}His Majesty urges all citizens to rest assured and rise above this tragedy.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.95,0:06:26.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That is all!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.48,0:06:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That's great! That's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.96,0:06:34.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's make the granary sturdier!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.33,0:06:48.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see... What are we missing...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.24,0:06:52.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.78,0:06:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Heavenly Father, forgive me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.56,0:07:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm too hungry to sleep!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.11,0:07:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Living as a human is so inconvenient!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.14,0:07:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Duralumin and Nylon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.90,0:07:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are they going now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.65,0:07:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.47,0:07:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Pardon the intrusion!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.67,0:07:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, well... what a fine gathering!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.90,0:07:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? Interrupting your meal, are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.90,0:07:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,How about joining me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.24,0:07:54.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, don't mind if I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.83,0:07:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,This smells great. What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.15,0:08:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a stewed mixture of earthworms, caterpillars, and spiders.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.60,0:08:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What about this delicious-looking fried dish?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.83,0:08:08.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, that's a toad.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.76,0:08:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Then how about centipede soup?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.62,0:08:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'll pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.75,0:08:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like none of it is to your liking.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.61,0:08:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,How about a drink, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.82,0:08:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,If it's booze...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.98,0:08:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll gladly take some.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.58,0:08:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Delicious! This hits the spot!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.06,0:08:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.41,0:08:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Newt wine really builds up your strength, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.81,0:08:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, I'm trying to eat here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.34,0:08:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Pardon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.59,0:08:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,We went through all that trouble using your power
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.61,0:08:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,to wipe out the wheat, but that meddling King of Goldland...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.60,0:08:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.99,0:08:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a single grain of wheat will reach them from Goldland.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.54,0:08:55.35,Default,,0,0,0,,So on their way...?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.37,0:09:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly. It's about time I fed my lovely rats.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.03,0:09:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,There, there. Good work coming all this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.74,0:09:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The wheat supply convoy will depart
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.49,0:09:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,tomorrow morning under Prince Franz of Goldland's command.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.47,0:09:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,So, where will you crush them?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.39,0:09:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,First, after leaving Goldland, the convoy will stay here,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.75,0:09:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,and camp around this area the next night.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.49,0:09:33.63,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll ambush them by this river and let the rats eat every last grain.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.65,0:09:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,But aren't there both eastern and western roads from Goldland?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.10,0:09:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,No, they are sure to take this western road.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.54,0:09:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The eastern road is a steep mountain path,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.78,0:09:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,making it hard for wagons loaded with wheat to pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.02,0:09:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if it's a detour, they'll undoubtedly take the flat western road.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.65,0:09:52.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.26,0:09:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You truly live up to your reputation as Lord X's right-hand man, Lord Rat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.25,0:10:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, I'm scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.63,0:10:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, we have a guests! Quiet down, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.42,0:10:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that true?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.43,0:10:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right. If we don't hurry, something terrible will happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.20,0:10:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.52,0:10:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.78,0:10:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.99,0:10:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire! Take me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.85,0:10:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,She gets so carried away whenever it comes to seeing Franz.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.68,0:11:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Come out, my rats! Come out and follow me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.72,0:11:18.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll feed you plenty of delicious Goldland wheat!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.65,0:11:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.02,0:11:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Franz, are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.35,0:11:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, no matter what happens, we'll deliver this wheat to Silverland!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.35,0:11:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Move out!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.96,0:12:21.85,Default,,0,0,0,,We're too slow!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.30,0:12:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, keep pushing!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.42,0:12:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Though we've still got quite a journey ahead of us...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.61,0:12:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz! I'm glad I made it in time!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.95,0:13:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Ribbon Knight! What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.13,0:13:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Sapphire sent this to you...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.24,0:13:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.04,0:13:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What? An ambush?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.95,0:13:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Franz, this is our chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.34,0:13:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's set a trap instead and wipe out those rats!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.55,0:13:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, let's do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.46,0:13:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,All set. Now we just wait for tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.93,0:14:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry! Night will fall before we know it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.92,0:14:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Tonight, I'll teach them a lesson!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.72,0:14:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, my lovely rats, go feast on the wheat in that wagon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.41,0:15:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The rats are acting strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.06,0:15:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a doll!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.55,0:15:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, this is gunpowder.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.86,0:15:18.75,Default,,0,0,0,,And oil... Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.00,0:15:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.70,0:15:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Now! Take that!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.41,0:15:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,My rats!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.70,0:15:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.49,0:15:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Over here! This way!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.36,0:15:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Come to me, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.78,0:16:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You poor things, forgive me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.82,0:16:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I let my guard down!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.91,0:16:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut the ropes!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.42,0:16:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Mark my words, Franz! I will have my revenge for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.83,0:16:58.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It's close.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.15,0:17:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Just as I thought!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.14,0:17:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,This dangerous pass is the exact spot they'd attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.81,0:17:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Landslide! Halt!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.44,0:17:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Curse that Ribbon Knight! Just you wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.44,0:17:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha! A hit! It hit!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.28,0:17:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Charge! Finish them off! Get them!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.34,0:17:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.50,0:18:01.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.52,0:18:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you alright, Ribbon Knight?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.31,0:18:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.00,0:18:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for saving me back there...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.28,0:18:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, you've saved me so many times yourself...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.36,0:18:14.19,Default,,0,0,0,,What about that wound?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.38,0:18:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nothing...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.46,0:18:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll have my men tend to it right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.62,0:18:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'm really fine. See you later!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.85,0:18:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Ribbon Knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.19,0:18:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What a strange fellow...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.15,0:18:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Loves me...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.62,0:18:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Loves me not...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.16,0:18:59.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Loves me...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.85,0:19:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-You're...!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.29,0:19:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I'm late.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.84,0:19:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you get that wound?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.57,0:19:19.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just careless with a rose thorn in the garden...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.20,0:19:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Any rose that dares hurt your beautiful hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.70,0:19:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd slice to pieces with this sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.06,0:19:26.79,Default,,0,0,0,,How sweet...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.94,0:19:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.83,0:19:59.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, the sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.50,0:19:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.30,0:20:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Now's the time!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.84,0:20:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Now stay still!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.62,0:20:38.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.12,0:20:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you attacking us?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.47,0:20:41.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Start talking!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.86,0:20:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,This is revenge for the rats you wiped out!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.72,0:20:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Rats?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.36,0:20:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry to interrupt, but would you mind letting that rat man go?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.20,0:20:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you saying, Lord Nylon?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.43,0:21:00.85,Default,,0,0,0,,So you teamed up with this man to...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.28,0:21:03.05,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.07,0:21:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,The plan was to use the rats to ravage the kingdom,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.97,0:21:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,then take it over.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.75,0:21:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.56,0:21:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that the plan has failed, I'm no longer needed here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.41,0:21:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll just go back and report to Lord X.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.43,0:21:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Th-That's impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.99,0:21:24.99,Default,,0,0,0,,See ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.51,0:21:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,W-Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.28,0:21:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry to bother you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.67,0:21:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.17,0:21:46.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.01,0:21:49.71,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough. Why don't you forgive him now?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.21,0:21:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What a hopeless bunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.74,0:21:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, I'm glad it's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.86,0:21:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,They were a formidable enemy, but this should teach the X-Union a lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.91,0:22:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I think they'd look great together if they got along like those dolls.
